 for the help that you are seeking is search within yourself, find the love of Jesus that you once knew and that you know is still there, speak to him and he will listen and answer. He loves you, but to keep killing his children is killing him all over again. Feel his pain, because he knows yours, and he will always be there for you all you have to do is ask and open the door! God Bless to you always BTK and I&#39;ll pray for you and your family to finally find the eternal peace that your soul deserves.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
