<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6419"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tippy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tippy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 07, 2005 - 3:31 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK - I obviously do not know if you are posting here or not, but if you are - you should be aware that just &#39;getting by with murder&#39; does not make you a smart boy.   <BR> <BR>Go ahead and say that the PD, FBI and CIA are off-track, although I don&#39;t think the CIA gives two hoots about your game.   <BR> <BR>But we&#39;re not off track - we the posters here.  We don&#39;t have the same evidence the aforementioned do.  You would not be playing your games if we did. You won&#39;t match wits with us directly because you KNOW better.   <BR> <BR>I don&#39;t care about your double letters and inuendo.  I don&#39;t care about what you place in cereal boxes. <BR> <BR>I want to know WHY you did what you did.  I want to know why you are doing what you are doing now.  I want to know what is inside your head.  I want to know how you grew up and the events that transpired that are and are not related to your killings.   <BR> <BR>You&#39;re not giving me anything of substance - so don&#39;t be surprised if I don&#39;t take part in your puzzles.  Why should any of us expend energy when we don&#39;t even know who the author is?   <BR> <BR>BTK - the REAL you - could be long dead.  A silly, misguided youngster could have found your stash, propagating all the games.   <BR> <BR>More and more everyday this entire scenario takes on a cartoon-like facade.   <BR> <BR>Forgive me - but I have never liked cartoons, not even as a child.   <BR> <BR>What are you doing?  Driving around and using other&#39;s wireless signals?  Is that why the posts are short?  You&#39;ve got to be moving on to the next one...?  Stopping at red lights, maybe?   <BR> <BR> <!--/Text--></td></tr>
