and the ones that do are just numbers that anyone can write down.  <BR> <BR>My point is that BTK has obviously shown great care in his communication work. He&#39;s offered numbering the communications so people aren&#39;t confused. There is a code so that police can know it is him. He releases unknown evidence in his letters, and even provides some ACTUAL evidence. All these letters coming out this decade are pre-planned, and telling a story. They are telling a BTK story.  <BR> <BR>BTK isn&#39;t going to come online and go &#34;Nah nah, you&#39;re all wrong! And I&#39;m going to KILL again ....Boooogity BOO!&#34; The ones who are saying that are selfish uncaring jerks behind a computer in some state not even bordering Kansas and they are LAUGHING at the fun.  <BR> <BR>IF BTK IS READING THIS THEN HE MUST .... MUST!!! ... provide PROOF of his online activities in a offline way. Via a postcard to the media station reffering to some online posts, and using a clever return address name that alludes to some online conversation or person! Then we will know that you are watching the public via this new technology. This is my only request from him, if he is reading this.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
