<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9187"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lostdog<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lostdog<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 2:29 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Come in BTK <BR> <BR>13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 <BR> <BR>1. The Breeding <BR> <BR>Blackness unwraps the flickering ghosts. <BR> <BR>A dancing milk light washes your oily face.  <BR>Alone once more in the balcony, you begin to beat the king beneath your lap jacket.  <BR>Repetition. <BR> <BR>The air inside you becomes a gray, burning, wrenching fist.  <BR>Lift your foot slightly to sense the candy pop sticky floor.  <BR>Your muscles lose control.   <BR> <BR>“…Here are the boots that made them… Your boots, Dick.”  <BR> <BR>It will hurt to breathe again.  <BR>Resuscitation. <BR>   <BR>“When you hit the end of the rope... your muscles lose control. I&#39;m afraid I&#39;ll mess myself.” <BR> <BR>Yes Perry, indeed you will. Don’t you remember? He says everyone does...  <BR>But, you will live again for me tomorrow.  <BR>Resurrection. <BR> <BR>X X X X X X X X X X X X X <BR> <BR>Outside, the wind erases the clacking of your footsteps. <BR>You dig your icy hands into lint pocked pockets and throw a sideways glance <BR>at the storefront panes. Yes, the haircut looks just like Perry’s. <BR> <BR>“Why don’t I feel sorry for them? I mean, the cruddy kid was my age.” <BR> <BR>“Aw, shut up Dick. Hell, why don’t you go and cry for ‘em like those B&#42;Tches <BR>bacK at the picture show? If that’s not why we got caught...then I don’t know what…” <BR> <BR>“Hey, we shoulda b%ll&#42;d that chick when she was all tied up and stuff…Huh…Perry?” <BR> <BR>“What? I should kill you Dick! You filthy… You weak, filthy coward. Don’t f-… do not forget. When we go out hunting again, I will call the shots.”  <BR> <BR>Now you round a corner, heading northeast. The windows are gone. <BR>Hugging the wall, you ditch the wind and listen to your boots.  <BR> <BR>13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 <BR>  <BR>2. The Morning Frenzy <BR> <BR>13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 <BR> <BR>3. The Fiasco <BR> <BR>13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 <BR> <BR>4. The Denial <BR> <BR>13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 <BR> <BR>5. Better Judgment <BR> <BR>13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 <BR> <BR>6. Dusk to Dawn <BR> <BR>13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 <BR> <BR>7. Look at me here I am <BR> <BR>13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 <BR> <BR>8. The Lapse <BR> <BR>13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 <BR> <BR>9. The Awakening <BR> <BR>13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 <BR> <BR>10. The Incubation <BR> <BR>Denny <BR> <BR>You didn’t spill your seed. You sowed it. <BR> <BR>You needn’t Kill again.  <BR>Your babies are out there now… doing your work. <BR> <BR>You mustn’t take these phenomena for granted.  <BR>You’ve begun more cycles than you’ve ended.  <BR> <BR>You couldn’t have spawned a more fertile inspiration for boys like yourself.  <BR>See what you’ve done. <BR> <BR>You wouldn’t want your legacy to die. <BR>So you broadcast it. <BR> <BR>You shouldn’t have. You shouldn’t have. <BR> <BR>Now Marc, now Bob, now John, now Jonathan, now Reginald <BR> <BR> <BR>13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 <BR>  <BR> <BR>11. The Offspring <BR> <BR>The Police will catch the weak ones <BR> <BR>Your captors may credit you for the quiet ones. <BR> <BR>Mothers will make new victims for the driven ones. <BR> <BR>Society will suffer through eternity for the clever ones. <BR> <BR>Oh yes, there will &#40;be&#41; more. <BR> <BR> <BR>13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 <BR> <BR> <BR>12. The Life <BR> <BR>No love. <BR> <BR>No hope <BR> <BR>No faith <BR> <BR>No reason <BR> <BR>No excuse <BR> <BR>No regret <BR> <BR>No truth <BR> <BR>No trust <BR> <BR>No peace <BR> <BR>No Savior <BR> <BR>No monster <BR> <BR>No cure <BR> <BR>No future <BR> <BR>No end <BR> <BR>13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 <BR> <BR>13. Oh! Death &#40;curtains&#41; <BR> <BR>Memory <BR>Precious treasure <BR>Cunning mistress <BR>Will she leave you, betray you, undo you? <BR> <BR>Confusion will be your new companion, old man <BR>A new, more mysterious madness awaits <BR>What was it you came into the room for? <BR>What was it you were going to say? <BR> <BR>Must not have been important <BR> <BR>Alone again I trod in past memory of mirrors and ponder wh….. <BR>Alone again I… <BR>Alone again I walk past… no <BR>Alone again I trod… I trod past memory of mirrors to… <BR>Memory of mirrors for… for… Perry?... Perry is that you? <BR> <BR>¬13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 13 <BR> <BR>Over and Out <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
