</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 11:03 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->RAEDELINA: I was sorry to see your belittling post. <BR> <BR>But I don&#39;t think sending BLT &#39;hate mail&#39; will boost his ego and make him think he&#39;s any more &#34;important&#34;, as you sarcasticly say. Not any more than him getting constant headlines in the national &amp; local papers &amp; being featured on hour-long specials like CNN&#39;s &#34;Larry King Live&#34;. <BR> <BR>If anything it will let him know how &#34;low&#34; &amp; vile a creature we all think he is. <BR> <BR>DUH!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10236-->
<!--Post: 10240--><!--Time: 1109835876-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10240"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Raedelina<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Raedelina<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 11:44 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->No disrespect meant to any who have spent time and effort on this perplexing case.  I just don&#39;t think &#40;and never have&#41; that &#34;BTK&#34; cares if society considers it low and vile.  In fact, I think it believes itself so superior that such a condemnation might actually be considered a compliment!  The two most important words here are SHOCK VALUE.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10240-->
<!--Post: 10288--><!--Time: 1109876517-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10288"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Juno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Juno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 11:01 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->How cool is it to belittle the positions of Compliance Officers and Dog Catchers?  There are a lot of people in the world who have those jobs.  I guess they should go shoot themselves now because they have worthless jobs, according to the catch btk brain trust  <BR> <BR>How cool is it to make disparaging remarks about homosexuals and prison rape?   <BR> <BR>How cool is it to use profanity in your posts? <BR> <BR>How cool is it to propagate stereotypes?  Bubba the redneck raping faggot?  <BR>Hey!  How about having &#34;Dueling Banjos&#34; as the new soundclip on the page?  I bet when Denny the Dogcatcher hears that he&#39;ll cry!!!  Or maybe everyone can make a recording telling him off and then mail it to him &#40;EAR/ONS---&#62;you reading this?&#41; <BR> <BR>How cool is that? <BR>DUH <BR> <BR>Hey BTK, I&#39;m never going to mow my lawn or pick up dog crap in my yard again!  Just to spite you.   <BR> <BR>BSA, even though I am an eagle scout,I hate you <BR> <BR>Lutheran Denomination---I hate you <BR> <BR>USAF--I hate you <BR> <BR>KAKE--I hate you <BR> <BR>Home Depot--I hate you <BR> <BR>PJ Ken and Barbie--I hate you all <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR>  <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10288-->
<!--Post: 10301--><!--Time: 1109884385-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10301"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Chiquitah<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Chiquitah<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 1:13 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->You have the right to say what you  want...as do the rest of the posters. <BR> <BR>Maybe it is the only way some can vent. <BR> <BR>Whatever it is, we are all glad he is in custody. <BR> <BR>Just so you know....Bubba is planning him a party!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10301-->
<!--Post: 10324--><!--Time: 1109897593-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10324"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:vscantu1@msn.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Vscantu<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 4:53 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Maybe BLT is now in the &#34;permanent dog pound&#34;, and won&#39;t get a chance to see this thread. But you know what? <BR> <BR>IT FEELS GREAT!! <BR> <BR>Hey BLT: You SUCK!! And now in more ways than one!! HA-hahahah! <BR> <BR>It&#39;s also very healthy to vent sometimes. And yes, sending him this printed out &#39;thread&#39;, updated occassionally would, if nothing else be very satisfying to many of us. As a matter of fact, having him know what we think of him is THE REASON THIS THREAD WAS STARTED in the first place! Why make it stop now just because we know where he is? <BR> <BR>And before he was caught noone was sure if he ever saw any of this. NOW if we send it to him by mail,  we KNOW HE&#39;LL SEE IT. <BR> <BR>And who knows, it might even have an effect on his personality as time goes on. <BR> <BR>Tick, tock, eh BLT??<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10324-->
<!--Post: 10330--><!--Time: 1109898163-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10330"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Audreyamw<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Audreyamw<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 5:02 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Dennis Rader:  Your secret symbol ID really sucks. <BR> <BR><a href="http://mg.photobucket.com/albums/v511/teriacarol/sign2.jpg" target=_top>http://mg.photobucket.com/albums/v511/teriacarol/s ign2.jpg</a> <BR> <BR>This is what we were all anxious to find out?  What is it supposed to represent?  A pair of breasts on skinny legs?  A pair of glasses on top of a crude road map?  I just don&#39;t get it.  Can you explain this for me when you get a chance?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10330-->
<!--Post: 10398--><!--Time: 1109920216-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10398"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:vscantu1@msn.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Vscantu<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 11:10 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think &#34;Dennis Rader&#34; has more to worry about than his symbol. But don&#39;t worry, he&#39;ll get his own.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10398-->
<!--Post: 10647--><!--Time: 1110079403-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10647"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Yomama<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Yomama<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 05, 2005 - 7:23 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->blt= big lousy tick<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10647-->
<!--Post: 10648--><!--Time: 1110080510-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10648"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Yomama<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Yomama<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 05, 2005 - 7:41 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->btk= bite the knuckle <BR> <BR>tick tock how long til you got caught..??? not very long <BR>how long will you matter...??? not very long <BR> you didn&#39;t give any thought to your wife, children, parents, church, friends,  nothing mattered to you...i hope that they can move on with their lives and try to forget you.  how dare you put them thru this you are lower than a vulture.. you reak of filth... you make me sick. how do you think your family feels  especialy your kids <BR> <BR>people am i wrong, but i do think that some prison inmates do have axcess to computers sso i don&#39;t think that it&#39;s to far fetched that one day he could be able to use a computer. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10648-->
<!--Post: 10789--><!--Time: 1110229876-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10789"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 07, 2005 - 1:11 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Good then he can read this. <BR>Rader, <BR>We all know you don&#39;t have a split personality, actually you have only one, the one who does not feel pain, sorrow, the one who doesn&#39;t care about anyone but himself, I feel bad for your family since you can&#39;t, I feel sorrow for your victims since you can&#39;t and I want you to know that you may be able to control the media and your priest and get them to feel sorry for you, but I don&#39;t, They say that there are people in this world who were born without souls and contribute in no way to socitey, YOU are one of those people and I know that I won&#39;t lose any sleep, wondering if your alright. I hope what you have done, starts giving you nightmares, I hope they invent something to make you feel, so you can remember how much pain you have caused for so many people and have to live every day with it, and I hope you live to be over one hundred years old rotting away in prison. there is a place for monsters like you, It&#39;s called Hell, I hope it comes to greet you in your little cell<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10789-->
