<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11097"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:vscantu1@msn.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Vscantu<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 09, 2005 - 7:30 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Yay, it&#39;s Denny The Dog Catchers birthday, and he&#39;s in the &#39;dog pound&#39;-permanently! Crappy birthday, Denny. I know noone- including your cherished family whose lives you&#39;ve forever RUINED will be celebrating. <BR> <BR>But hey, &#34;this is the first day of the rest of your life.&#34; A life, unfortunately, that will only get WORSE for you as the days go by. Wahooo! Party Hardy!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11097-->
